# "Your commander" is found wherever it is (CR 903.3e). Kytheon cast from the command zone with Path of Ancestry's {W}
# shares a creature type with itself on the stack (the ruling: "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of
# Ancestry ... you'll scry 1"): Mountain to the bottom. Two turns later, with Kytheon on the battlefield, Elite Vanguard
# (Human Soldier) cast with Path's {W} scries again: Island to the bottom, Forest on top.
